WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.520
A million Earths.

00:02.220 --> 00:06.181
Jupiter, the largest planet, is a tenth as wide as the Sun.

00:06.631 --> 00:09.647
More than a million Earths would fit inside it.

00:10.097 --> 00:16.188
No screen can show them side by side: with the Sun at this size, the Earth would be a speck.
